    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Expense Spending Lookup (bonus B2, sub-workflow used as a tool)\nWhen Executed by Another Workflow (employeeEmail, category) -> Get Employee Expenses -> Category Match -> Summarize Spending -> Format Result.\n\nCalled by the Expense Chat Agent. Returns one text in the field result: sums of claimed and approved amounts per decision (approved, rejected, pending) and currency. An empty category means all categories. Setup: Data Table expenses.",
